    "identifier": "hoshigaki-apex-berserker",
    "description": "<p>3rd Level Clan Feature</p>\n<p>You’ve learned to tap into your bestial heritage, becoming more shark like in your physical features, turning you into more of a monster than a man.</p>\n<p>As a bonus action, you transform, enter your Apex Predator state. This form has you take on a shark like form, growing large gills, large wing link fins from your shoulders, and web between your fingers. You can remain in this state for 1 minute. Once you enter this state, if you enter it again before completing a long rest, you gain 1 rank of exhaustion.</p>\n<p>Beginning at 11th level, you can enter this state once per rest before gaining ranks of exhaustion.</p>",
